<header><p class="enc-kicker"><a href="/encyclopedia/conflicts/16th-century">Conflicts &amp; Resolutions</a> · War</p><h1 class="enc-title">Civil wars between the conquistadors in Peru</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates"><a href="/years/1537">1537</a>–<a href="/years/1554">1554</a></span> · <a href="/centuries/16th-century">16th century</a></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">The civil wars between the conquistadors in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/peru">Peru</a> were fought from 1537 to 1554 among the Spanish conquerors of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/inca-empire">Inca Empire</a> and against royal authority. <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/francisco-pizarro">Francisco Pizarro</a> defeated <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/diego-de-almagro">Diego de Almagro</a> at Las Salinas (1538), Almagro's followers killed Pizarro in 1541, and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/gonzalo-pizarro">Gonzalo Pizarro</a> rebelled against the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/new-laws">New Laws</a> and killed the first <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/viceroy-of-india">viceroy</a> before he was defeated and executed in 1548.</p></div>
